    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "married_Shane",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm happy that Shane's in such a good place. I've never seen him smile so much!#$e#With his love for chickens, I'm sure he'll fit right in on %farm Farm!$h",
      "translation": "Mám radost, že se Shaneovi tak dobře daří. Ještě nikdy jsem ho neviděla tolik se usmívat!#$e#Protože miluje slepice, na farmu %farm určitě dokonale zapadne!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "78ec9ffbf687b95cc771748abfe51ac3fc78c993bfb866de50f93be7a66a2075",
      "translationSHA256": "1a96c22880ca89f65d88c946772d1da6201281256c6d39b3a27130d7fe349248",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
