    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)430",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, where'd you find that? *sniff*... Mmm... This will be perfect, grated over a fresh pasta. Thank you!$h",
      "translation": "Hej, kde se ti to podařilo najít? *přičichne*... Mmm... Nastrouhaný na čerstvých těstovinách bude dokonalý. Děkuji!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "a1df6ca9f0143130306b220ea50f6d35870df46f863cfd6a1eb7133ee8777ca0",
      "translationSHA256": "1722928e62dab941cb21a334bd17fa31a19fc699b4b3428d94a3431c986f3b9e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
