    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "dating_Leah_memory_oneday",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Please don't feel like you have to spend all your time with me now that we're dating... I know you're a busy person!",
      "translation": "Neměj prosím pocit, že teď, když spolu chodíme, se mnou musíš trávit všechen čas... Vím, že máš spoustu práce!",
      "sourceSHA256": "16c6340a4c3e31cab6bc67ca78e3bd03c1f5fc6ff08b4f907b3319aa8608eee6",
      "translationSHA256": "6138104457bbc9461ed0a7c7121c4d97e71dcc516e73a896cdb540075639e002",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "eventSeen_53_memory_oneday",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I sold enough art at that show to get by for another year... that's all I needed!",
      "translation": "Na té výstavě jsem prodala dost umění, abych vyžila další rok... Nic víc jsem nepotřebovala!",
      "sourceSHA256": "7ffca6062f5928645c994a3f2944bfc4fe7158b5057cc2f0818a30d62c5a20c6",
      "translationSHA256": "bf5f372b2c462bb0d805f74342d084b395eb25f3a362df4395c9163f80377860",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "eventSeen_54_memory_oneday",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm still fuming about the picnic... what a weirdo!$a#$b#Let's never talk about... that person... ever again.$s",
      "translation": "Kvůli tomu pikniku pořád zuřím... Taková podivná osoba!$a#$b#Už nikdy o... té osobě... nemluvme.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "b6c8bac3a2603130a70750575fa7e141b197776237cc4b1f32304de8cd1bfa2d",
      "translationSHA256": "f642cdd0f6d6c9ef7f951709fdc4b6e8bd0b08a3b5ab2aa483261a7d13311434",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "eventSeen_584059_memory_oneday",
      "field": null,
      "source": "If my art continues to sell online like it has, I'll be able to keep making art forever. That's always been my dream.",
      "translation": "Jestli se mé umění bude na internetu dál prodávat tak jako dosud, budu ho moct tvořit navždy. Vždycky to byl můj sen.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c6e98c57724970384f1a0ea993b811a5ad03c7871dad417a4d8d994e04f95fdb",
      "translationSHA256": "ed556d0592e0700f9f1d0da68b66306dabf7eff5abd0ad75f884e12b927e2d3d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Entering",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't tell anyone, but Willy let me steer the boat for a few minutes.$h",
      "translation": "Nikomu to neříkej, ale Willy mě nechal několik minut řídit loď.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "f3b134f2c0238a31a7745cf0e45adedfc683fa2af19d715270301a402b349346",
      "translationSHA256": "6f550f85e1b10c364a3b77e65c554754fd9a45e0ba93c5f59d86ea0dee80ed7c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Leaving",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Well, that was deeply relaxing.",
      "translation": "Tak to jsem si opravdu dokonale odpočinula.",
      "sourceSHA256": "7e369fbf2d7d98584e225468e57280840ad8c8ae7dac62f1f02799dd467c36c2",
      "translationSHA256": "265186bff3032f09a854fa270d0c95c25781a30bf7ac4aba369f2c1641cbecde",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I love the weather in Stardew Valley, but seeing a different climate now and then helps put things into perspective.",
      "translation": "Počasí v údolí Stardew miluji, ale vidět čas od času jiné podnebí pomáhá člověku získat odstup.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e5c320f6bdc20158dc332dfe7fd7ae2be795ca1da6434fc9f01065ca7a22b17f",
      "translationSHA256": "c568cde8f4ed0bc5a94153bf103de64cbdf7d287144c7a6ac9f19e9e8ba516b4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Shore",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The shape of the waves here is awe inspiring.#$e#I wonder if I could ever capture that sort of formlessness in a sculpture.",
      "translation": "Tvar zdejších vln ve mně probouzí úžas.#$e#Přemýšlím, jestli bych někdy dokázala zachytit takovou beztvarost v soše.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c9c824a727c66ad3e665c7d1aeec619676521c9066d1d5aba8e610c5d7afaa9b",
      "translationSHA256": "51c8ca95f01fe3d86e763cb636c98c7710fd9b7399b4773c8fb210bf5f45a763",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Chair",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I like the heat as long as I'm keeping perfectly still.$h",
      "translation": "Horko se mi líbí, pokud zůstanu úplně nehybná.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "2a7741502c9d923cfa77e5c1986c251fdabcda31d769fbf3c9e0d990a2e10fa9",
      "translationSHA256": "0f1b305339bea44b127d4d8e1f40d642e32c86a19295c38f07537e653a80cf0a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Wander",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Mmm, I bet the trees around here would make for an interesting medium to work with.#$e#Though Willy probably wouldn't be happy with me if I dragged a bunch of logs onto his ship!$h",
      "translation": "Mmm, vsadím se, že zdejší stromy by byly zajímavým materiálem k tvorbě.#$e#Willy by ale asi neměl radost, kdybych na jeho loď dotáhla hromadu klád!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "0e34f03a6acab6027c399378f452a5c0056b143ee5cd4ae46f7ebf64363fefe6",
      "translationSHA256": "bd11d2374e9cf26598431192c75429c287a9e5761abdf849b9ea0e949f2a584c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Wander_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I wonder what kind of things you could forage out here.#$e#I think I saw some tasty looking walnuts growing on a bush nearby.",
      "translation": "Zajímalo by mě, co všechno by se tu dalo nasbírat.#$e#Myslím, že jsem na nedalekém keři viděla růst lákavé vlašské ořechy.",
      "sourceSHA256": "86250cc27a92d5c8d6b1b036e3ad1c7ac8147b18133839eea2040c5de11edcbf",
      "translationSHA256": "e3d4fd1afaaa25cd50427e1f13e932ad75509591ed5b70c4650a616e02a43f8f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Leah",
      "key": "Resort_Bar",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Have you tried the Piña Colada? I'm on my second one... hehe.",
      "translation": "Už máš ochutnanou piña coladu? Já už piju druhou... hehe.",
      "sourceSHA256": "85f05789d0b6f288cc19bc20f9abc98811257f8b3def3c436c83deda4fb392c8",
      "translationSHA256": "7dec0e7ee1e987aa64f7737c4507dbe48c6a0b2e0e18faf69b921e91386adbd2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
